:"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-15T18:21:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T20:58:44Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118616","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118616","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118616.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118616.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:23Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\nFixes #118141.\r\n\r\n## Case\r\n\r\n```\r\nmatch x:\r\n    {\"key\"}:\r\n        ...\r\n```\r\nThe above code would previously crash the TreePrinter but with the fix will correctly print:\r\n```\r\n...\r\nMatch x :\r\n|   { \"key\" } :\r\n|   |   ...\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\n`print_match_pattern` was not expecting the value to be null. \r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\nThese changes only affect the TreePrinter. \r\n\r\n1. The value is only printed when there is a key (and value). \r\n2. The colon is only printed when there is both a key and value.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nHelp with adding a test would be appreciated.\r\n\r\nIt seems the gdscript parser tests don't check the printer. I am able to cause the issue using the existing `match_dictionary` test.\r\n```\r\n./bin/<godot>.exe --headless --test gdscript-parser modules/gdscript/tests/scripts/parser/features/match_dictionary.gd\r\n```\r\nI tested all the other files in `tests/scripts/parser` and none of the others fail this check.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118616/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}